  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at chapter heading for Jus 1300) #9782-A, eff 9-11-10, EXPIRED: 9-11-18 New. #12656, INTERIM, eff 11-1-18, EXPIRED: 4-30-19 New. #12909, eff 10-24-19 (from Jus 1301.05)",
